+    /// Creates a new Note instance.
+    /// - Parameters:
+    ///   - id: Unique identifier for this note.
+    ///   - sessionID: ID of the parent session.
+    ///   - content: The note content.
+    ///   - category: Category of the note.
+    ///   - aiModel: Information about the AI model used.
